      "statusTitle": "Service status",
      "statusBody1": "DotSound aims to operate as an information intermediary under Article 1253.1 of the Civil Code of the Russian Federation. The service may include user-generated materials uploaded by DotSound users, as well as external tracks for which DotSound stores metadata and a link to the original source.",
      "statusBody2": "For user uploads, audio files may be hosted in DotSound infrastructure. For external tracks, DotSound must not present itself as the rights holder and must clearly show the source of the material.",
