      "noticeItem4": "link to the track page in DotSound",
      "noticeItem5": "description of the violation",
      "noticeBody3": "After receiving a properly formatted notice, DotSound reviews it and takes measures to restrict access to or remove disputed information within timelines required by applicable law.",
